llowing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[hermit2, series-rows, unresolved, devbig014, role=impl]\n\nPlain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nHermit's full validation currently cannot produce a qualifying receipt on main: the Rust-script build starts eight Cargo jobs inside a 2 GiB cgroup and was OOM-killed, while the completion audit also rejects integration tests that the DAG executes without typed declarations. This restores a runnable, auditable graph without skipping or relabelling any gate.\n\nTask\n\nThis is the validation prerequisite for https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3009. It lowers all five generated Rust-script producer variants from eight to two Cargo jobs while retaining the existing 2 GiB cap and CARGO_BUILD_JOBS channel. It adds the missing `analyze` and `liteinst_advanced` declarations and teaches the audit parser that the existing `prlimit` command is an execution wrapper.\n\nDeterminism\n\nNo scheduler, guest execution, or record/replay behavior changes. The DAG retains the same commands, dependencies, and validation gates; only build parallelism metadata and truthful integration-test registration change.\n\nLinux Semantics\n\nNo Linux syscall or process semantics change. `prlimit` is recognized only by the static audit parser as the wrapper already present in a validation command.\n\nValidation\n\n- canonical DAG generation and `--check` passed\n- all 15 `validation_dag` tests passed\n- all 13 audit-parser mutation tests passed\n- registration audit passed with 55 registered binaries and zero undeclared\n- `scripts/validate.rs --self-test` passed under required cgroup containment in 5m45s\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`, Python compilation, and `git diff --check` passed\n","created_at":"2026-09-14T07:16:05Z","updated_at":"2026-09-14T07:55:49Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11681812195,"node_id":"LA_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAACuEpO4w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/labels/adversarial-review-codex1","name":"adversarial-review-codex1","color":"5319e7","default":false,"description":"Codex adversarial review round 1 completed","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11685076479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAACuHwd_w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/labels/passed-review-codex","name":"passed-review-codex","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Codex adversarial review PASSED at current PR head","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3010/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3010/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3010/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/1f26de2c6a8291076a87019c31fbb1037386282b","head":{"label":"rrnewton:validation-prereq-series-rows-20260914","ref":"validation-prereq-series-rows-20260914","sha":"1f26de2c6a8291076a87019c31fbb1037386282b","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_ur