ON","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":562,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3010"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3010"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3010"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3010/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3010/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3010/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/1f26de2c6a8291076a87019c31fbb1037386282b"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3009","id":4522874683,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAABDZWXOw","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3009","diff_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3009.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/3009.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3009","number":3009,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Preserve native diversity evidence","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[hermit2, slots-recon, unresolved, devbig014, role=impl]\n\n## Plain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nNative control runs now retain the ordered process outcome and full observation hash for every inner attempt, together with the producer-owned diversity requirement and observed count. This lets canonical reporting show why the control passed and keeps identical successful observations as an auditable insufficient-diversity failure rather than mislabeling them as a product crash.\n\nTask: preserve_native_attempt_observation\n\nThe change introduces CellResult schema 5 and stress-series/v4, validates the narrow native evidence shape and its outer classification, keeps older series rows readable, and updates exact-schema result consumers. Missing, partial, reordered, malformed, or contradictory evidence is refused.\n\n## Determinism\n\nThe representation preserves producer output in attempt order and recomputes distinct hashes with a set only for cardinality. It introduces no host time, random value, iteration-order dependency, or guest-visible behavior.\n\n## Linux Semantics\n\nThis changes result recording and classification only. Guest execution and Linux process behavior are unchanged; status, signal, and timeout observations are retained exactly.\n\n## Validation\n\nAt exact head `086ec9b3c423127c4980a41df435c39a1a23c0d1`:\n\n- `cargo test -p hermit-manifest-plan`: 222 passed\n- `./scripts/validate.rs --self-test`: passed\n- `./ci/compat-envelope/scorecard.rs self-test`: passed\n- `./ci/compat-envelope/scorecard.rs check`: passed\n- `cargo fmt --all -- --check`: passed\n- `cargo clippy --workspace --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed\n\nThe parent projection and website suites are validated in the coordinated dev-hermit change.\n","created_at":"2026-09-14T04:31:25Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T21:05:29Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[{"id":11685076479,"node_id":"LA_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAACuHwd_w","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/labels/passed-review-codex","name":"passed-review-codex","color":"0E8A16","default":false,"description":"Codex adversarial review PASSED at current PR head","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":11734316363,"node_id":"LA_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAACu2t1Sw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/labels/adversarial-review-codex3","name":"adversarial-review-codex3","color":"BFD4F2","default":false,"description":"Codex adversarial review round 3 conducted","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3009/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/3009/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/3009/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/e26c832e98e23eff3044c874467c0a991827c20f","head":{"label":"rrnewton:preserve-native-attempt-observation-20260914","ref":"preserve-native-attempt-observation-20260914","sha":"e26c832e98e23eff3044c874467c0a991827c20f","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https