updated_at":"2026-09-17T19:31:24Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-17T19:31:22Z","git_url":"git://github.com/rrnewton/hermit.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:rrnewton/hermit.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit","homepage":null,"size":247745,"stargazers_count":1,"watchers_count":1,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":0,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":562,"license":{"key":"other","name":"Other","spdx_id":"NOASSERTION","url":null,"node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTA="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":[],"visibility":"public","forks":0,"open_issues":562,"watchers":1,"default_branch":"main"}},"_links":{"self":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2969"},"html":{"href":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2969"},"issue":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2969"},"comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2969/comments"},"review_comments":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2969/comments"},"review_comment":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}"},"commits":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2969/commits"},"statuses":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/e7af5cd8e5a80a0b74be5f44f26b33d4798c2697"}},"author_association":"OWNER","auto_merge":null,"assignee":null,"active_lock_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2958","id":4449512135,"node_id":"PR_kwDOIZiOrM8AAAABCTYqxw","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2958","diff_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2958.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2958.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2958","number":2958,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Prepare harness-managed verify evidence","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[hermit2, mega-lander, unresolved, devbig014, role=impl]\n\n## Plain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nThis draft prepares the validation harness to replace internal `--verify-json` execution with two harness-managed ordinary runs whose evidence can be retained and audited. It centralizes the BitwiseInfoV1 comparison in the shared Rust library, adds typed ordinary-run evidence for supported paths, implements deterministic retained-log publication with bounded and restart-safe accounting, and preserves a reviewed continuation scheduler for the later atomic cutover.\n\nThis does not activate the cutover. The live harness still uses the existing single `--verify --verify-json` command. DBT exact guest stdout/stderr still requires a DynamoRIO core-level separation, SaBRe still lacks an authoritative ordinary-run log channel, and schema/scorecard/retained-artifact integration remains outstanding.\n\nTask: flip-verify-to-two-harness-managed-runs-with-retained-logs\n\n## Determinism\n\nAll comparison callers use the same fixed BitwiseInfoV1 implementation in `detcore::logdiff`. The retained gzip has deterministic metadata and is bound to the exact compared bytes by raw and compressed hashes, sizes, peer digest, cell identity, attempt, and selected INFO count. Publication is transactional, budgeted with checked arithmetic, restart-reconciled, and reviewed against path replacement, partial writes, crashes, aliases, and concurrent writers. The active validation path is intentionally unchanged until every backend prerequisite is sound.\n\n## Linux Semantics\n\nThis draft does not change guest syscall semantics. Ordinary ptrace capture preserves exact guest status/stdout/stderr. DBT ordinary log decoding now rejects authenticated backend/tool failures before publication and removes transport-only initialization records after validating the protected evidence; DBT typed stream capture remains refused because launcher/core and guest fd1/fd2 are not structurally separated. SaBRe remains refused for the same evidence-quality reason.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `cargo test -p hermit-manifest-plan --all-targets`: 249 passed\n- `cargo test -p hermit --features dbt --bin hermit`: 242 passed\n- Detcore-model canonical verdict tests: 19 passed\n- Detcore BitwiseInfoV1 tests: 11 passed\n- Cross-backend script self-test: 46 passed\n- Real ptrace retained pair: 323/323 selected INFO records, matched\n- Real DBT retained pair: 9/9 selected INFO records, matched\n- Ptrace-to-DBT and DBT-to-ptrace controls: both diverge at record 5 as expected; no parity or L2 claim\n- Formatting, warning-denied Clippy, pin validation, shell syntax, diff, and repository-cleanliness checks passed\n\nBroader DBT CLI validation remains 106/113; the seven failures are existing DBT or feature-matrix limitations reproduced or classified separately. This draft is not ready to merge.\n","created_at":"2026-09-05T08:01:26Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T10:26:46Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2958/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2958/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2958/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/f18b76cc464a3f8f7704f2d7abdbf53baff157e0","head":{"label":"rrnewton:feature/verify-two-harness-managed-runs-v2","ref":"feature/verify-two-harness-managed-runs-v2","sha":"f18b76cc464a3f8f7704f2d7abdbf53baff157e0","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":563646124,"node_id":"R_kgDOIZiOrA","name":"hermit","full_name":"rrnewton/hermit","private":false,"owner":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"ht