on/hermit/pull/2904","diff_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2904.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton/hermit/pull/2904.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2904","number":2904,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"demos: move the unified suite into Hermit","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"[hermit2, dagrun, unresolved, devbig014, role=impl]\n\n## Plain Language Summary and Project Impact\n\nMove the unified demo suite into Hermit so its workflows run entirely inside the public repository on Hermit's available self-hosted runners. The existing Hermit demo directory is merged rather than replaced, and the imported suite keeps its filtered source history.\n\nThe moved demos resolve Hermit at the repository root, use in-repository support scripts, route direct Hermit execution through `bin/safehermit`, and fetch the pinned QEMU kernel from a public rrnewton/hermit release. The Demo Hot Path no longer needs a private dev-hermit checkout.\n\nTask: move-demos-directory-into-hermit\n\n## Determinism\n\nThe move preserves the existing fixed inputs, exact binary selection, content hashes, repeat comparisons, and serialized artifact publication. Demo 2 deliberately builds and names the debug Hermit binary: the same source's release binary records successfully but replay exits 125 after the bootstrap exec returns EFAULT. That release defect is not relabelled as a pass.\n\nDemo 7 now runs through safehermit, identifies QEMU by its unique QMP argument across the wrapper's process boundary, and stops the exact transient unit before waiting for the wrapper's complete report.\n\n## Linux Semantics\n\nNo Hermit syscall or guest semantics change. The suite's existing process, QEMU, snapshot, and guest commands are retained; only repository ownership, dependency paths, and validation wiring change.\n\n## Validation\n\n- Demos 1-7: PASS at exact head ancestry, independently reviewed. Demo 2 used the documented debug binary qualification.\n- Demo 7 after the safehermit fix: two reproducible 84-to-85 task-list evolutions, complete wrapper reports, both exact transient services unloaded, no surviving matching processes.\n- Demo unit tests: 48/48 PASS.\n- Demo review checker regression tests: 15/15 PASS.\n- `bin/safehermit-test.sh`: 16/16 PASS.\n- Shellcheck, Python compilation, YAML parsing, dependency checks, and public kernel digest verification: PASS.\n- `make lint-checks`: PASS before the final rebase; after rebasing, the previously external checker-scheduling main red is repaired by landed main commit `7e4613564` and the live checker passes.\n- Full `make validate` previously stopped before changed code because `build.rust_scripts` failed; the same workspace error was reproduced on untouched base `2738b00dd`. The newer base has not been claimed fully validated here.\n\nDemo 8 was deliberately not executed by this agent. The demo-review gate now requires coverage per PATH and refuses an attestation older than the last change to that path, so a partial trailer is no longer mechanically accepted and the requirement no longer needs restating here. At the current head the gate is honestly RED at rc=1 with 20 stale runnable paths, awaiting a distinct reviewer's trailer; the author must not self-attest.\n\nAssurance: demos 1-7 runtime evidence only. Backend and relaxations are those declared by each demo; no broader Hermit L-level claim is made.\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-31T19:22:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-16T23:57:11Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2904/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/2904/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/issues/2904/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rrnewton/hermit/statuses/33a8f546deac001a2ae41f1a1706a0c9f9fc9b85","head":{"label":"rrnewton:move-demos-directory-into-hermit","ref":"move-demos-directory-into-hermit","sha":"33a8f546deac001a2ae41f1a1706a0c9f9fc9b85","user":{"login":"rrnewton","id":274582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3NDU4Mg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/274582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton","html_url":"https://github.com/rrnewton","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rrnewton/events{/privacy}","rec